oCw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["用餐日：2026.04.11\n餐點：野菜薩摩揚湯蕎麥麵、章魚燒、紅油鮮蝦抄手\n\n蕎麥麵體Q彈，薩摩揚吸飽湯汁的感覺不錯，湯頭偏清淡，整碗燙燙的很適合冷天吃啊~；\n在日式居酒屋裡出現抄手很稀奇，但Q彈的內餡和調味不輸台式小吃；\n章魚燒屬於日式的軟嫩口感(非焦脆的類型)，內餡很燙、有微微紅薑的香氣。\n\n整體餐點調味不厚重，感覺滿多熟客的，是個感覺很溫暖的店。",null,[0,38]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVldKWE9YbGFWbVJ4V2taUmRGTnRUbmhTVlRVMVVtMWFVVmt5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVldKWE9YbGFWbVJ4V2taUmRGTnRUbmhTVlRVMVVtMWFVVmt5WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVldKWE9YbGFWbVJ4V2taUmRGTnRUbmhTVlRVMVVtMWFVVmt5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVldKWE9YbGFWbVJ4V2taUmRGTnRUbmhTVlRVMVVtMWFVVmt5WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVldKWE9YbGFWbVJ4V2taUmRGTnRUbmhTVlRVMVVtMWFVVmt5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXVldKWE9YbGFWbVJ4V2taUmRGTnRUbmhTVlRVMVVtMWFVVmt5WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,7836,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WVWJXOXlaVmRxWkZRdFNtTnhSVTU1Um1aUVkyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x86bc9d6de5b4a54f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmVUbW9yZVdqZFQtSmNxRU55RmZQY2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WVWJXOXlaVmRxWkZRdFNtTnhSVTU1Um1aUVkyYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WVWJXOXlaVmRxWkZRdFNtTnhSVTU1Um1aUVkyYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WVWJXOXl