null,null,null,1,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_400_TO_600"],"$400-600",2,null,"$400 到 $600","0ahUKEwjE9JCtvdKWAxUZbPUHHcqxIr8Q3YcHCPgBKAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjE9JCtvdKWAxUZbPUHHcqxIr8Q3IcHCPcBKAg",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjE9JCtvdKWAxUZbPUHHcqxIr8Q3IcHCPkBKAk",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjE9JCtvdKWAxUZbPUHHcqxIr8Q3IcHCPoBKAo",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjE9JCtvdKWAxUZbPUHHcqxIr8Q3IcHCPsBKAs",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[[[["M:/g/11pl2g3k60"],"日式牡蠣咖哩飯",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjE9JCtvdKWAxUZbPUHHcqxIr8Q3YcHCP0BKAA"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjE9JCtvdKWAxUZbPUHHcqxIr8Q3IcHCPwBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這間「不二家日式料理」算是中山這邊很平價、實在的小店，主打各種定食、拉麵、咖哩飯，整體是比較家常、親民的路線，沒有浮誇的裝潢，但吃得飽、吃得舒服，價格也很合理。\n\n這次用餐點了幾道餐點，簡單分享一下心得：\n•\t扁食湯：湯頭清爽，餛飩皮薄餡多，搭配海帶和蔬菜，喝起來很暖胃，味道偏淡，適合當開胃湯品。\n•\t炸雞咖哩飯：咖哩是偏家常風味，不是重香料派，唐揚雞外酥內嫩、保有肉汁，份量不少，炸物控可以點。\n•\t牛肉烏龍麵：湯頭比較普通，整體走台式家常感，吃完有飽足感，但沒有特別記憶點。\n•\t炸豬排咖哩飯：豬排炸得酥脆不油膩，厚度適中，咖哩口味樸實，適合日常簡單吃飯，不會有負擔。\n•\t煎餃：這次最喜歡的一道小菜，外皮煎得酥脆，內餡多汁，調味適中，搭配沾醬很加分，是整餐裡 CP 值最高的品項。\n\n整體來說，不二家是屬於那種「肚子餓想吃個簡單、平價、吃得飽」的好選擇。沒有浮誇的擺盤或創意料理，但味道穩定，價格實惠，份量充足。\n\n很適合家庭聚餐、學生族群，或是平日想快速解決一餐、不想踩雷的時候來吃。",null,[0,80]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVUkphRFptY21SUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVUkphRFptY21SUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVUkphRFptY21SUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/loca